msgstr "You want to back up that escalation with some weapons fire?"

#: scripts/scenario_30_broken_glass.lua:3190
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid ""
"We oversee the B-3 liquidation of the Ghosts assets.\n"
"\n"
"Dock with us to check out what we've got."
msgstr "We oversee the B-3 liquidation of the Ghosts assets.\n\nDock with us to check out what we've got."

#: scripts/scenario_30_broken_glass.lua:3198
msgctxt "drone-comms"
msgid ""
"You need any of this stuff?\n"
"\n"
"It's not for sale, as such. You'll need to get a requisition from the Admin "
"Station in order to carry anything out.\n"
msgstr "You need any of this stuff?\n\nIt's not for sale, as such. You'll need to get a requisition from the Admin Station in order to carry anything out.\n"

#: scripts/scenario_30_broken_glass.lua:3203
msgctxt "drone-comms"
